All 129 panels/charts/states/strings render from the bound @Observable ClimateControlPageModel and the
Localizable.xcstrings catalog; web key names preserved verbatim. ClimateSnapshot mirrors the web
ClimateState field-for-field (all SI °C); the production KMP vehicle-systems store drops into the
ClimateControlDataSource seam (ADR-004 — no networking in the view), the same seam the sibling
VehicleCost/DiskForecast pages use. The three web hooks (useClimate / useClimateHistory /
useChargingTelemetryLatest.not_enough_power_to_heat) are composed into ClimateData. SI converters
(P1/S5): temperatures stored °C, converted to the user's unit only at the render boundary by
ClimateFormat.displayTemperature (the affine KMP convertTempFromSI: °F = °C·1.8 + 32) driven by
@Environment(\.tsUnits); gauges + tables + charts + the passenger card all convert there. The 3
RadialGauges are native Circle().trim gauges (value+unit, arc=value/max, gaugeMax 131°F/55°C); the
LineChart + AreaChart use the P3 native Swift Charts wrappers (TSLineChart/TSAreaChart) — never a
WKWebView. Live-SSE staleness: N/A — useClimate/useClimateHistory are TanStack poll/refresh queries,
not live streams (ADR-013 scope), matching the web.

