================================================================================
DISPOSITION
================================================================================
A complete, HIG-native SwiftUI ClimateControlPage shipped at parity with the web source: a pure @Observable
state holder (ADR-004 — no networking in the view) exposing loading/empty/error/success over an injectable
ClimateControlDataSource seam whose ClimateSnapshot mirrors the web ClimateState 1:1 in SI °C. The page reproduces
the web chrome (title/subtitle/Refresh), the HVAC status banner (power state + Active/Off + comfort + Climate
Keeper/Defrost/Battery Heater/Insufficient-Power chips), the three temperature RadialGauges, the 13-card climate
status grid + 4-card protection row, the Thermal Comfort trio (score/delta/status circles), the Climate Efficiency
quartet, the Seat Heaters grid (front/rear heaters, auto-seat-climate, seat cooling + ventilation, heat legend),
the Temperature History LineChart, the AC State & Fan Speed AreaChart, and the 7-column adaptive Climate History
